sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Logged-in User
  participant API as FastAPI Billing
  participant DB as MongoDB Replica Set
  participant P as payOS/SePay
  participant IN as Webhook Inbox
  U->>API: POST order with idempotency key
  API->>DB: Create pending order (integer VND)
  API->>P: Create provider QR/payment link
  P-->>API: QR/link + reference + expiry
  API-->>U: pending + QR + amount + account + transfer text
  U->>P: Bank-app transfer (external)
  P->>IN: Signed webhook over HTTPS
  IN->>IN: Verify signature and deduplicate
  alt authentic event + matched order
    IN->>DB: Short transaction: status paid + immutable ledger + wallet + outbox
    DB-->>IN: Commit once
    IN-->>P: 2xx ACK
    U->>API: GET order/status
    API-->>U: paid + updated credits
  else invalid / mismatch / duplicate
    IN->>DB: Reject or manual-review / record event
    IN-->>P: Provider-appropriate ACK or error
  end
